\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids shows October to November under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025, November to December came in at 52% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 46% and February to March at 45% on the middle. Grid 16352 had its driest year in 1954 at 62%.</p>"}
